tailed long description of \"Shimmering blue crystal boots\".;;;;Why do you have to answer to these questions? ;;Someone has to check these Qs. if i am lazy or eager to be o wizard;;A SIMPLE CODING TEST (not obligatory, but if you want to show your skills):**Celtron**Subj: plaahDate: Jun 16evvk rtry siis**Forath**Subj: WizappDate: Jun 24Mud name: Forath SilverfangFirst name: EsaLast name: Tikkamäki  Email: esa.tikkamaki@luukku.comStreet address: Kirkkopuistikko 5 a 19City: VaasaCountry: FinlandOTHER INFORMATION:Do you have a stable internet connection at your home (modem, ISDN, solid) ?DSLIf you don't, from where do you play mud?Do you have an access to a linux shell?No, but I use Ultraedit (with ftp)Have you used a mudclient (tinyfugue, zmud, ..) and if you have, what client? TF, Zmud, SimpleMUMOTIVATION TEST (take your time to answer these):Why do you want to be a wizard? I have great new ideas about how to make the mud a bit more realistic (in a fantasy way)Also some new ideas about areas.Do you have any previous experience with LPC? What? 4 years of coding LPC.Do you have any other experience with coding? What? Visual basic, html, WAP!, modding (morrowind ie.)How well do you know this mud and it's function? Describe. I would say quite well. 4 years of experience.For how long have you played this mud? I'd recon 4 years.Have you played other muds? For how long? Batmud, this one, ud3, and some which do not exist anymore.Have you read any fantasy literature? What, and in what language? Sci-fi, horror, comedy, parody, adventure. Mostly in Finnish but also in English.Do you have any experience with real roleplaying games? 5 years. Runequest, Palladium, Ad&d, Ad3, Robotech, Star Trek. All kind of...Why don't wizards have the right to tell mortals mud information? Because they're mortals and are on 'need to know' basis.And also they're supposed to find it by them selves.Why don't you have the right to make test equipment for your mortal friends orgive them advice or other benefits? Test equipment is ONLY for wizards. If you give a test EQ to a mortal, you'd have to give it to them all. And that would ruin the mudding experience (too easy exp/money/etc.)Why do you have to accept any order given to you by the higher wizards? Er... they're higher than me and the punishment for not obeying their orders might me BAD.What would you code as a wizards? Area ideas etc. Give as detaileddescription as possible. Mainly areas but later i'd like to make a guild (a long time dream of mine). Also some racial stuff. (trolls would have sunlight as would a dark elf, etc.)Give a language rich example of a room description of 2-4 lines (this isthe quality of desciption that you will be expected in your possiblefuture area). The outer courtyard surrounds you. The measurements of it are almost divine.You notice a peculiar aspect that there are no knights or other noble humans here. Justan abandoned cart stand in the corner of the yard. The ground is worn smooth and some carttracks go here and there.Give a detailed long description of \"Shimmering blue crystal boots\".The shimmering crystal boots are made of the purest crystal known to realms.Some magical runeshave been imprinted on the both sides of the boots. They emit eerie blue light. They feel quite incofortableto your feet but they givethe neccessary protection agains some attacks. Some say that there was a councilof mages that used to make these kinds of boots as ceremonial purposes and that they give the user a great protection agains magical attacks.Why do you have to answer to these questions?Because they are neccessary for me to be acceptedamongst the great wizards of QuesMud realm. It would be REALLY stupid ifthese questions would not exist and everyone a friend to a wiz wouldbe accepted to one. They would surely spoil everyones mudding pleasure (or pain)A SIMPLE CODING TEST (not obligatory, but if you want to show your skills):Give a simple example of the use of call_other efun:Declare an integer variable and give it a value:Do a simple loop with 'while' or 'for' efun:Make an array variable with 3 empty slots in it:Reset a mapping variable and add something to it:**Forath**Subj: Thief ehdotuksiaCc: forathDate: Jun 24Lahetan ehdotuksia thief kiltaa.. hitaaseen mutta varmaan tahtiin. Olis hyva/kiva jos voisit laittaa naita eteenpain:Eli thieffeilla vois olla thieves cloak (tms.), joka estais niita nakymasta oikealla nimellaa. Esim finger ei nayttais mitaan... \"Someone\" approaces. ja who nayttais vaan someone, eika levelia. Olisko kiva? :)Laitan lisaa sitten kun keksin. ok?**James**Subj: Outworld monstersDate: Jun 24Niin, tuosta sen verran, etta haluutko etta ne tulee niinku bandit encounterit vai etta niita vaa tulee aina sillo tallon johonki roomii?Helpottas huomattavasti ku tietas tuon verran... muuten taa kylla onnistuu...++James**Forath**Subj: Thief asiaaDate: Jun 26Niin, mutta entas mun idea tosta Thieves cloakista?Olisko kayttokelpoinen?Ma vaha spammaan sua :)On mulla joskus sitte lisaakin ideoita, mutta ma haluisin sitte testailla tifuja jos ja kun ne tulee peliin, ok?**Celtron**Subj: ragin vois melkee demittaaDate: Jun 30**Golthar**Subj: wizzzzzzzzzzDate: Jul 11ajattelin tossa noin wisuttamista ku täällä ei tosiaankaan hirveästi enää tapahtu pelaajien osalta. täällä on noi pari aktiivista pelaajaa, joista ei hirveästi muille ekspapartyja liikene ja vielä vähemmän ekupartyja, että wisuttaisin, koodaisin arean ja rupeisin ottamaan witch-kiltaa kontolleni. mun mielestä pelaajat täällä ansaitsee kuitenki jotain vaihtelevaa tohon normaaliin mitä tää mudi tällä hetkellä tarjoaa... lpc-kokemusta nyt on se perustavara. tuolla neophyten mudissa (insossa) oon tällä hetkellä muunmuassa wisuna. mut oppiahan voi koko ajan lisää:) ilmottele mit